s-guide .sg-track{grid-auto-columns:72%}.salus-guide .sg-nav button{width:34px;height:34px}}@media(max-width:900px){.salus-guide .hero-content{position:static;background:#13251f;padding:44px 0 52px}.salus-guide .hero-text{max-width:none}.salus-guide h1{font-size:clamp(32px,7vw,48px)}.salus-guide .trust{flex-direction:column;gap:6px;margin-top:18px}}@media(max-width:760px){.salus-guide .wrap{padding:0 20px}.salus-guide .grid,.salus-guide .split{grid-template-columns:1fr}.salus-guide section{padding:55px 0}.salus-guide .split{gap:26px}.salus-guide .toc .wrap{gap:19px}}\n</style>\n<div class=\"salus-guide\">\n  <header class=\"hero\"><img class=\"hero-img\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0720/7695/1854/files/Untitled_design_b9d77176-4801-43b0-8ba2-7d9f47eea281.png?v=1791557090&amp;width=1920\" srcset=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0720/7695/1854/files/Untitled_design_b9d77176-4801-43b0-8ba2-7d9f47eea281.png?v=1791557090&amp;width=750 750w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0720/7695/1854/files/Untitled_design_b9d77176-4801-43b0-8ba2-7d9f47eea281.png?v=1791557090&amp;width=1100 1100w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0720/7695/1854/files/Untitled_design_b9d77176-4801-43b0-8ba2-7d9f47eea281.png?v=1791557090&amp;width=1500 1500w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0720/7695/1854/files/Untitled_design_b9d77176-4801-43b0-8ba2-7d9f47eea281.png?v=1791557090&amp;width=1920 1920w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0720/7695/1854/files/Untitled_design_b9d77176-4801-43b0-8ba2-7d9f47eea281.png?v=1791557090&amp;width=2048 2048w\" sizes=\"100vw\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1158\" fetchpriority=\"high\" alt=\"Three friends relaxing inside a modern outdoor cube sauna at sunset\"><div class=\"hero-content\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"hero-text\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">THE SALUS SAUNAS GUIDE</span><h1>The Complete Home Sauna Buyer's Guide</h1><p>Traditional, infrared, or a little of both? Find the right heat, fit, and setting for the way you want to unwind.</p><div class=\"trust\"><span>✓ Free shipping in the USA</span><span>✓ Manufacturer warranty</span><span>✓ Expert customer service &amp; technical support</span><span>✓ Trusted for over 15 years</span></div></div></div></div></header>\n  <nav class=\"toc\" aria-label=\"On this page\"><div class=\"wrap\"><a href=\"#sg-types\">Sauna types</a><a href=\"#sg-traditional\">Traditional</a><a href=\"#sg-infrared\">Infrared</a><a href=\"#sg-hybrid\">Hybrid</a><a href=\"#sg-placement\">Indoor or outdoor</a><a href=\"#sg-compare\">Compare</a><a href=\"#sg-products\">Featured saunas</a><a href=\"#sg-faq\">FAQ</a></div></nav>\n  <section class=\"intro\" id=\"sg-types\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">START HERE</span><h2>First, choose how you want to feel the heat.</h2><p class=\"lead\">The best home sauna is the one you'll look forward to using. Start with your preferred heat experience, then consider where it will live and how it will be powered.</p><div class=\"grid\"><article class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">01 / CLASSIC HEAT</span><h3>Traditional saunas</h3><p>Hot air and heated stones create the familiar, enveloping sauna experience. Add water to the stones where the heater permits for a burst of steam.</p><a class=\"link\" href=\"#sg-traditional\">Explore traditional →</a></div></article><article class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">02 / GENTLE WARMTH</span><h3>Infrared saunas</h3><p>Infrared emitters warm the body directly in a lower-temperature room. Choose far infrared or full spectrum based on the heater experience you prefer.</p><a class=\"link\" href=\"#sg-infrared\">Explore infrared →</a></div></article><article class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">03 / BOTH WORLDS</span><h3>Hybrid saunas</h3><p>Pair a traditional heater with infrared technology in one cabin, with flexibility to choose the style of session you want.</p><a class=\"link\" href=\"#sg-hybrid\">Explore hybrid →</a></div></article></div></div></section>\n  <section id=\"sg-traditional\"><div class=\"wrap split\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">01 / TRADITIONAL</span><h2>The timeless ritual of heat and steam.</h2><p>Traditional saunas use an electric or wood-fired heater to warm the air and stones. They're a natural choice if you love an intense, classic sauna session and the option of steam when the heater supports it.</p><ul class=\"checklist\"><li>Best for lovers of high heat and classic sauna ritual</li><li>Consider heater type, ventilation, and dedicated electrical service</li><li>Available in indoor and weather-ready outdoor designs</li></ul><a class=\"link\" href=\"/collections/traditional-sauna-v2\">Shop traditional saunas →</a></div><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" style=\"object-position:center 30%\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0720/7695/1854/files/hf_20261009_152550_857717d2-93cc-4720-8940-fdac7a3406db.png?v=1791559765&amp;width=1024\" alt=\"Water poured from a wooden ladle onto hot stones of an electric sauna heater, releasing steam\"></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"sg-carousel\"><div class=\"sg-head\"><h3>Traditional saunas</h3><div class=\"sg-nav\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"/collections/traditional-sauna-v2\">View all →</a><button type=\"button\" data-dir=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Previous\">‹</button><button type=\"button\" data-dir=\"1\" aria-label=\"Next\">›</button></div></div><div class=\"sg-track\">{%- for product in collections['traditional-sauna-v2'].products limit: 12 -%}<a class=\"sg-item\" href=\"{{ product.url }}\">{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 600 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', sizes: '(max-width: 600px) 72vw, 25vw', alt: product.title }}<span class=\"sg-t\">{{ product.title }}</span><span class=\"sg-p\">{% if product.price_varies %}From {% endif %}{{ product.price_min | money_without_trailing_zeros }}{% if product.compare_at_price_min > product.price_min %}<s>{{ product.compare_at_price_min | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</s>{% endif %}</span></a>{%- endfor -%}</div></div></div></section>\n  <section id=\"sg-infrared\" style=\"background:#fbf2e9\"><div class=\"wrap split\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0720/7695/1854/files/hf_20261009_152651_c1eca66b-21ae-4d1e-a58d-d4a9bb4aac59.png?v=1791559821&amp;width=1024\" alt=\"Close-up of glowing full spectrum infrared panels inside a wooden infrared sauna\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">02 / INFRARED</span><h2>A different kind of warmth.</h2><p>Infrared heaters radiate warmth toward your body rather than primarily heating the air. The room feels milder than a traditional sauna, making it appealing if you prefer a gentler-feeling session.</p><p><strong>Far infrared</strong> models focus on far-infrared wavelengths. <strong>Full spectrum</strong> models combine near, mid, and far infrared emitters. Compare the actual heaters and controls on each model rather than assuming every cabin is the same.</p><a class=\"link\" href=\"/collections/all-infrared-saunas\">Shop infrared saunas →</a></div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"sg-carousel\"><div class=\"sg-head\"><h3>Infrared saunas</h3><div class=\"sg-nav\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"/collections/all-infrared-saunas\">View all →</a><button type=\"button\" data-dir=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Previous\">‹</button><button type=\"button\" data-dir=\"1\" aria-label=\"Next\">›</button></div></div><div class=\"sg-track\">{%- assign sg_pinned = 'element-2-person-full-spectrum-infrared-sauna,element-king-3-person-full-spectrum-infrared-sauna,grand-element-person-full-spectrum-infrared-sauna' | split: ',' -%}{%- for handle in sg_pinned -%}{%- assign product = all_products[handle] -%}{%- if product.id -%}<a class=\"sg-item\" href=\"{{ product.url }}\">{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 600 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', sizes: '(max-width: 600px) 72vw, 25vw', alt: product.title }}<span class=\"sg-t\">{{ product.title }}</span><span class=\"sg-p\">{% if product.price_varies %}From {% endif %}{{ product.price_min | money_without_trailing_zeros }}{% if product.compare_at_price_min > product.price_min %}<s>{{ product.compare_at_price_min | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</s>{% endif %}</span></a>{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}{%- for product in collections['all-infrared-saunas'].products limit: 15 -%}{%- unless sg_pinned contains product.handle -%}<a class=\"sg-item\" href=\"{{ product.url }}\">{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 600 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', sizes: '(max-width: 600px) 72vw, 25vw', alt: product.title }}<span class=\"sg-t\">{{ product.title }}</span><span class=\"sg-p\">{% if product.price_varies %}From {% endif %}{{ product.price_min | money_without_trailing_zeros }}{% if product.compare_at_price_min > product.price_min %}<s>{{ product.compare_at_price_min | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</s>{% endif %}</span></a>{%- endunless -%}{%- endfor -%}</div></div></div></section>\n  <section id=\"sg-hybrid\"><div class=\"wrap split\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">03 / HYBRID</span><h2>One space. More ways to sauna.</h2><p>Hybrid or combination saunas bring traditional heat and infrared into one cabin. They're especially compelling for households with different preferences, or anyone who wants options from day to day.</p><ul class=\"checklist\"><li>Choose between available heating modes by model</li><li>Confirm circuit and heater requirements before ordering</li><li>Check dimensions and installation clearances</li></ul><a class=\"link\" href=\"/collections/hybrid-sauna-v2\">Shop hybrid saunas →</a></div><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1448\" height=\"1086\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0720/7695/1854/files/Cozy_Cedar_Sauna_with_Infrared_Glow.png?v=1791559794&amp;width=1200\" alt=\"Hybrid sauna interior with an electric heater and stones next to glowing infrared panels\"></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"sg-carousel\"><div class=\"sg-head\"><h3>Hybrid saunas</h3><div class=\"sg-nav\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"/collections/hybrid-sauna-v2\">View all →</a><button type=\"button\" data-dir=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Previous\">‹</button><button type=\"button\" data-dir=\"1\" aria-label=\"Next\">›</button></div></div><div class=\"sg-track\">{%- for product in collections['hybrid-sauna-v2'].products limit: 12 -%}<a class=\"sg-item\" href=\"{{ product.url }}\">{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 600 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', sizes: '(max-width: 600px) 72vw, 25vw', alt: product.title }}<span class=\"sg-t\">{{ product.title }}</span><span class=\"sg-p\">{% if product.price_varies %}From {% endif %}{{ product.price_min | money_without_trailing_zeros }}{% if product.compare_at_price_min > product.price_min %}<s>{{ product.compare_at_price_min | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</s>{% endif %}</span></a>{%- endfor -%}</div></div></div></section>\n  <section class=\"intro\" id=\"sg-placement\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FIND YOUR FIT</span><h2>Indoor convenience or outdoor escape?</h2><p class=\"lead\">Both can make room for a lasting ritual. The right location depends on your available space, utilities, and environment.</p><div class=\"grid\"><article class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-body\"><h3>Inside the home</h3><p>Measure the room, doorway, and ceiling height. Plan for ventilation and required clearances, and confirm the model's circuit requirements before you buy.</p><a class=\"link\" href=\"/collections/indoor-saunas\">Explore indoor saunas →</a></div></article><article class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-body\"><h3>Out in the elements</h3><p>Choose a model designed for outdoor use. Plan a level foundation, weather exposure, drainage, access, and a safe electrical run.</p><a class=\"link\" href=\"/collections/outdoor-saunas\">Explore outdoor saunas →</a></div></article><article class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-body\"><h3>Before you commit</h3><p>Review the specific model's manual for exact dimensions, heater specifications, wiring, and clearances. A licensed electrician can assess your site.</p></div></article></div></div></section>\n  <section class=\"comparison\" id=\"sg-compare\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SIDE BY SIDE</span><h2>Compare sauna experiences.</h2><p class=\"lead\">Typical ranges are a starting point, not product specifications. Actual performance varies by heater, cabin, ambient conditions, and model.</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Consideration</th><th>Traditional</th><th>Infrared</th><th>Hybrid</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Operating temperature</td><td>Typically 150–195°F</td><td>Typically 110–150°F</td><td>Depends on selected mode</td></tr><tr><td>Heat-up time</td><td>Often 30–60 minutes</td><td>Often 10–30 minutes</td><td>Depends on selected mode</td></tr><tr><td>Power requirements</td><td>Often dedicated 240V circuit; varies by heater</td><td>Some models use 120V; larger models may need 240V</td><td>Often dedicated 240V; verify model</td></tr><tr><td>Experience &amp; wellbeing</td><td>High ambient heat, optional steam; relaxation and warmth</td><td>Lower ambient heat, radiant warmth; relaxation and warmth</td><td>Flexible heat experience; relaxation and warmth</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"note\">Sauna use is not a medical treatment. Ask a healthcare professional if sauna use is appropriate for you.</p></div></section>\n  <section class=\"products\" id=\"sg-products\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">EXPLORE THE COLLECTION</span><h2>Find a sauna to call your own.</h2><div class=\"grid\"><article class=\"card product\"><a href=\"/products/monarch-ii\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"960\" height=\"960\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0720/7695/1854/files/SaunaImages-NEW_21.png?v=1790699698&amp;width=960\" alt=\"Monarch II traditional outdoor sauna for 3 people\"></a><div class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">TRADITIONAL / 3 PERSON / OUTDOOR</span><h3>Monarch II</h3><p>A traditional outdoor retreat with room to share the ritual.</p><a class=\"link\" href=\"/products/monarch-ii\">View Monarch II →</a></div></article><article class=\"card product\"><a href=\"/products/prana-1-2-person-compact-infrared-sauna\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"960\" height=\"960\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0720/7695/1854/files/Prana.png?v=1779902770&amp;width=960\" alt=\"Prana far infrared indoor sauna for 2 people\"></a><div class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">INFRARED / 2 PERSON / INDOOR</span><h3>Prana</h3><p>A compact far infrared cabin for one or two, sized for a spare room, home gym, or office corner.</p><a class=\"link\" href=\"/products/prana-1-2-person-compact-infrared-sauna\">View Prana →</a></div></article><article class=\"card product\"><a href=\"/products/renew-king\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"960\" height=\"960\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0720/7695/1854/files/95.png?v=1774470474&amp;width=960\" alt=\"Renew King hybrid outdoor sauna for 3 people\"></a><div class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">HYBRID / 3 PERSON / OUTDOOR</span><h3>Renew King</h3><p>A traditional heater and infrared panels in one outdoor cabin, so every session can match your mood.</p><a class=\"link\" href=\"/products/renew-king\">View Renew King →</a></div></article></div></div></section>\n  <section id=\"sg-faq\"><div class=\"wrap faq\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">GOOD TO KNOW</span><h2>Home sauna questions, answered.</h2><details><summary>Which type of sauna is best for home use?</summary><p>It depends on your heat preference, available space, and electrical setup. Traditional saunas offer hotter air and optional steam, infrared offers lower ambient temperatures, and hybrid combines both experiences.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need a dedicated electrical circuit?</summary><p>Many saunas do. Requirements vary by model and heater: some smaller infrared units may use 120V, while many traditional and hybrid units need a dedicated 240V circuit. Check the product manual and consult a licensed electrician.</p></details><details><summary>Can I put an indoor sauna outside?</summary><p>Only if the model is rated for it. Indoor-only saunas are not built for the weather. Some indoor/outdoor models can sit outside under a covered structure such as a patio, but for full exposure to sun, rain, and snow, choose a sauna designed for outdoor use and follow its foundation, clearance, and maintenance guidance.</p></details><details><summary>How long does a home sauna take to heat up?</summary><p>As a general guide, infrared saunas may be ready in about 10–30 minutes and traditional saunas in about 30–60 minutes. Actual times vary with the model, heater, and surrounding temperature.</p></details><details><summary>What is the difference between far infrared and full spectrum?</summary><p>Far-infrared saunas use far-infrared heaters. Full-spectrum saunas include near, mid, and far infrared wavelengths. Compare the heater layout and specifications of individual models before choosing.</p></details><details><summary>Does a home sauna require maintenance?</summary><p>Yes. Keep benches and floors clean and dry, follow the heater's care instructions, and inspect outdoor structures for weather-related wear. Always follow the maintenance instructions for your specific model.</p></details></div></section>\n  <section class=\"cta\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"color:#c3e8dd\">YOUR NEXT CHAPTER</span><h2>Make space for the ritual.</h2><p>Find the sauna that fits your home, your pace, and the way you like to unwind.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/collections/all-saunas\">Shop all saunas →</a></div></section>\n</div>\n<script>document.querySelectorAll('.salus-guide .sg-carousel').forEach(function(c){var t=c.querySelector('.sg-track');c.querySelectorAll('[data-dir]').forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener('click',function(){t.scrollBy({left:(+b.dataset.dir)*t.clientWidth*0.9,behavior:'smooth'})})})});</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which type of sauna is best for home use?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"It depends on your heat preference, available space, and electrical setup. Traditional saunas offer hotter air and optional steam, infrared offers lower ambient temperatures, and hybrid combines both experiences.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I need a dedicated electrical circuit?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Many saunas do. Requirements vary by model and heater: some smaller infrared units may use 120V, while many traditional and hybrid units need a dedicated 240V circuit. Check the product manual and consult a licensed electrician.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I put an indoor sauna outside?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Only if the model is rated for it. Indoor-only saunas are not built for the weather. Some indoor/outdoor models can sit outside under a covered structure such as a patio, but for full exposure to sun, rain, and snow, choose a sauna designed for outdoor use and follow its foundation, clearance, and maintenance guidance.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How long does a home sauna take to heat up?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"As a general guide, infrared saunas may be ready in about 10–30 minutes and traditional saunas in about 30–60 minutes. Actual times vary with the model, heater, and surrounding temperature.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the difference between far infrared and full spectrum?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Far-infrared saunas use far-infrared heaters. Full-spectrum saunas include near, mid, and far infrared wavelengths. Compare the heater layout and specifications of individual models before choosing.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does a home sauna require maintenance?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Keep benches and floors clean and dry, follow the heater's care instructions, and inspect outdoor structures for weather-related wear. Always follow the maintenance instructions for your specific model.\"}}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.salussaunas.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Home Sauna Buyer's Guide\",\"item\":\"https://www.salussaunas.com/pages/home-sauna-buyers-guide\"}]}</script>",
